Electron adaptation notes (45-x-y): Electron's
refactor_expose_file_system_access_blocklist.patch moves GenerateBlockPaths()
and its kBlockPaths table from chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc
into chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.h so that Electron can call
it, so the new `*/.mvn` kBlockWrite suffix rule is added to the header's copy
of the table (same position, after the .git/modules rule) instead of the .cc.
